    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="a901fb88-48bd-59f3-b840-7f24d9062596" activityNameId="ffe106eb-ab9f-52ca-a34d-14ecf640c964" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Semi-dense asphalt (SDA) surface layer, 0% recycling, high temperature, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Semi-dense asphalt (SDA) surface layer, 0% recycling, high temperature, at plant
Modern Swiss technologies for regional storage facilities, material extraction, and asphalt production. Based on survey data from 73 asphalt mixing plants. 
UUID: b773ddb2-89b4-4d93-a642-10284fd05567
This dataset covers the production of average semi-dense asphalt (SDA) surface layers in Switzerland, with 0% reclaimed asphalt. The process represents an average SDA, derived from the mean material composition of SDA 4-12 and SDA 8-12 layers. It includes raw material extraction, transportation, and manufacturing processes.
Location: Switzerland
Technology: Production of hot mix semi-dense asphalt SDA, using industrial machinery.
Time period: Review of data currency scheduled after 5 years.
Production volume: 351352456 t 
Sampling: Survey
Extrapolations: None
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_b773ddb2-89b4-4d93-a642-10284fd05567.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
